rest of Europe",[169],{"start":42,"end":170,"type":83},47,{"type":24,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":27},"Evri’s Netherlands fulfilment centre is located in Vianen, offering 70,000 sq ft of modern warehousing space in the heart of Europe. ​",[],{"type":24,"text":175,"spans":176,"direction":27},"Strategically positioned for fast access to key EU markets, the site enables efficient cross-border shipping, EU-wide distribution, and local fulfilment for eCommerce, retail, and B2B businesses.",[],{"type":24,"text":91,"spans":178,"direction":27},[179],{"start":42,"end":94,"type":83},{"type":24,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":27},"Evri NL B.V​\nLaanakkerweg 16, 4131 PB,​\nVianen, Netherlands",[183,185,188],{"start":42,"end":184,"type":83},12,{"start":186,"end":187,"type":83},13,39,{"start":189,"end":99,"type":83},40,{"type":24,"text":191,"spans":192,"direction":27},"Scroll down to see what services we provide and categories we suppose in our Europe fulfilment centre:",[],{"dimensions":194,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":195,"id":196,"edit":197},{"width":54,"height":55},"explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjnOPIqRLdaBhNz_USAhubevrilogo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C44%2C1024%2C681&w=1000&h=665","aAjnOPIqRLdaBhNz",{"x":42,"y":198,"zoom":43,"background":44},44,{"link_type":34},{"link_type":34},"landing_feature_banner$9166d004-5e59-4361-ab19-473aab908095",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":203,"primary":204,"id":208,"slice_type":119,"slice_label":20},[],{"Image":205},{"tablet":206,"mobile":207},{},{},"photo_block$58dea05a-c5f4-4b34-b16e-59288e7174f1",{"variation":121,"version":17,"items":210,"primary":221,"id":228,"slice_type":160,"slice_label":20},[211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220],{"Col1Content":124,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":127,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":129,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":131,"Col2Content":132},{"Col1Content":134,"Col2Content":135},{"Col1Content":137,"Col2Content"