207,"video_banner$fddaf0f2-1469-4bce-a026-fed10650e487","video_banner",{"variation":73,"version":17,"items":248,"primary":249,"id":289,"slice_type":111,"slice_label":20},[],{"theme":20,"show_premium_logo":20,"label":20,"label_theme":20,"titleH2":250,"bodyText":251,"image":282,"rightImage":69,"buttonText":20,"buttonLink":287,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"primary_button_external":20,"button_secondary":288,"secondary_button_external":20},"New Jersey, USA",[252,257,260,263,268,274,279],{"type":24,"text":253,"spans":254,"direction":27},"Effective fulfilment in North America",[255],{"start":42,"end":256,"type":83},37,{"type":24,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":27},"Evri’s U.S. fulfilment center is strategically located in the East Coast close to major ports, spanning over 130,000 sq. ft. and is purpose-built to support scalable, high-volume operations. ​",[],{"type":24,"text":261,"spans":262,"direction":27},"With over 15,000 pallet locations, the site enables flexible, reliable, and efficient order processing for eCommerce, retail, and B2B clients across North America.",[],{"type":24,"text":264,"spans":265,"direction":27},"Locations:",[266],{"start":42,"end":267,"type":83},10,{"type":269,"text":270,"spans":271,"direction":27},"list-item","20 Farinella Drive, East Hanover, NJ 07936​",[272],{"start":42,"end":273,"type":83},43,{"type":269,"text":275,"spans":276,"direction":27},"4 Taft Rd, Totowa, NJ 07512",[277],{"start":42,"end":278,"type":83},27,{"type":24,"text":280,"spans":281,"direction":27},"Scroll down to see what services we provide and categories we suppose in our North American fulfilment centre: ",[],{"dimensions":283,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":284,"id":285,"edit":286},{"width":54,"height":55},"explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjnN_IqRLdaBhNy_eh-warehouse-outside-evri-logo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=9%2C0%2C1039%2C691&w=1000&h=665","aAjnN_IqRLdaBhNy",{"x":94,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"link_type":34},{"link_type":34},"landing_feature_banner$8e6f205d-2c0c-49b6-a667-8a18b1df01a0",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":291,"primary":292,"id":296,"slice_type":119,"slice_label":20},[],{"Image":293},{"tablet":294,"mobile":295},{},{},"photo_block$9826d1d7-14e8-404d-871c-deede6c50713",{"variation":121,"version":17,"items":298,"primary":309,"id":316,"slice_type":160,"slice_label":20},[299,300,301,302,303,304,305,306,307,308],{"Col1Content":124,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":127,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":129,"Col2Content":135},{"Col1Content":131,"Col2Content":132},{"Col1Content":134,"Col2Content":132},{"Col1Content":137,"Col2Content":135},{"Col1Content":139,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":141,"Col2Content":132},{"Col1Content":143,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":145,"Col2Content":135},{"SectionTitle":20,"SectionSubtitle":20,"Col1Header":147,"Col2Header":148,"InformationTableButtonUrl":310,"InformationTableButtonText":157,"isTableShort":158},{"link_type":150,"key":311,"kind":152,"id":312,"url":313,"name":314,"size":315},"c8ebf3db-be67-47a1-9fcc-5866e780b3d2","aCNcnidWJ-7kSByd","explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaCNcnidWJ-7kSByd_Evrifulfillmentservicecustomerplaybook-USA.pdf","404-not-found.html","1563573","information_table$b9df3fdd-b89e-4e00-bf53-940575dffffc",{"variation":73,"version":17,"items":318,"primary":319,"id":359,"slice_type":111,"slice_label":20},[],{"theme":20,"show_premium_logo":20,"label":20,"label_theme":20,"titleH2":320,"bodyText":321,"image":350,"rightImage":158,"buttonText":20,"buttonLink":357,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"primary_button_external":20,"button_secondary":358,"secondary_button_external":20},"Oman",[322,327,330,333,337,347],{"type":24,"text":323,"spans":324,"direction":27},"Your ideal solution for Middle East fulfilment",[325],{"start":42,"end":326,"type":83},46,{"type":24,"text":328,"spans":329,"direction":27},"The Oman warehouse is a modern fulfilment centre with over 13,000 sq ft of dedicated space and total capacity exceeding 37,000 sq ft. Equipped with ambient storage, flexible racking, and a full fulfilment management system, it offers secure inventory storage, accurate picking and packing, and shipping to domestic and international destinations. ​",[],{"type":24,"text":331,"spans":332,"direction":27},"Strategically located with airside access to Muscat International Airport, it enables fast inspection, clearance, and delivery across the region.",[],{"type":24,"text":334,"spans":335,"direction":27},"Location: ",[336],{"start":42,"end":267,"type":83},{"type":24,"text":338,"spans":339,"direction":27},"Old cargo building, Airport Heights, Seeb, ​\nMuscat​\nSultanate of Oman",[340,341,344],{"start":42,"end":198,"type":83},{"start":342,"end":343,"type":83},45,52,{"start":345,"end":346,"type":83},53,70,{"type":24,"text":348,"spans":349,"direction":27},"Scroll down to see what services we provide and categories we suppose in our Oman fulfilment centre: ",[],{"dimensions":351,"alt":352,"copyright":20,"url":353,"id":354,"edit":355},{"width":54,"height":55},"Evri's Barnsley hub interior, displaying vast rows of parcel sorters and conveyors","explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ5uM0JbqstJ9-DCa_Barnsley-Interior-01.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C5%2C6000%2C3990&w=1000&h=665","Z5uM0JbqstJ9-DCa",{"x":42,"y":356,"zoom":43,"background":44},5,{"link_type":34},{"link_type":34},"landing_feature_banner$50021116-65fa-4868-82cd-7ece6cf15e75",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":361,"primary":362,"id":366,"slice_type":119,"slice_label":20},[],{"Image":363},{"tablet":364,"mobile":365},{},{},"photo_block$f07889d7-1025-4bb0-88a8-9fd9316ac594",{"variation":121,"version":17,"items":368,"primary":379,"id":386,"slice_type":160,"slice_label":20},[369,370,371,372,373,374,375,376,377,378],{"Col1Content":124,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":127,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":129,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":131,"Col2Content":132},{"Col1Content":134,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":137,"Col2Content":132},{"Col1Content":139,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":141,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":143,"Col2Content":125},{"Col1Content":145,"Col2Content":125},{"SectionTitle":20,"SectionSubtitle":20,"Col1Header":147,"Col2Header":148,"InformationTableButtonUrl":380,"InformationTableButtonText":157,"isTableShort":158},{"link_type":150,"key":381,"kind":152,"id":382,"url":383,"name":384,"size":385},"952d1ef2-b794-43d9-a5fc-ebe525daa7f1","aCNcoCdWJ-7kSByf","explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaCNcoCdWJ-7kSByf_Evrifulfillmentservicecustomerplaybook-Oman.pdf","404-not-found.html","2428178","information_table$2c8f3858-423c-496f-b2bd-af0d39a3c8eb",{"variation":73,"version":17,"items":388,"primary":391,"id":455,"slice_type":111,"slice_label":20},[389,390],{},{},{"theme":20,"show_premium_logo":20,"label":20,"label_theme":20,"titleH2":392,"bodyText":393,"image":444,"rightImage":69,"buttonText":451,"buttonLink":452,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"primary_button_external":20,"button_secondary":454,"secondary_button_external":20},"Interested in our global fulfilment service?",[394,397,401,405,410,415,420,425],{"type":24,"text":395,"spans":396,"direction":27},"Get in contact with one of our team to discuss:",[],{"type":269,"text":398,"spans":399,"direction":27},"Reliable & Scalable Fulfilment – Late cut-offs, integrated tracking ",[400],{"start":42,"end":82,"type":83},{"type":269,"text":402,"spans":403,"direction":27},"Global Reach & Local Expertise – UK, US, EU support with localized fulfilment ",[404],{"start":42,"end":82,"type":83},{"type":269,"text":406,"spans":407,"direction":27},"Certified Warehousing – Safety and efficiency-certified operations ",[408],{"start":42,"end":409,"type":83},22,{"type":269,"text":411,"spans":412,"direction":27},"Data & Insights – Real-time analytics and customizable dashboards ",[413],{"start":42,"end":414,"type":83},15,{"type":269,"text":416,"spans":417,"direction":27},"E-Commerce & Omni-Channel Optimization – Seamless marketplace integrations ",[418],{"start":42,"end":419,"type":83},38,{"type":269,"text":421,"spans":422,"direction":27},"Customer Support – Self-service & rapid escalation tracking",[423],{"start":42,"end":424,"type":83},16,{"type":24,"text":426,"spans":427,"direction":27},"Or read more about our fulfilment services for a comprehensive breakdown of everything we offer.",[428,443],{"start":429,"end":430,"type":431,"data":432},3,42,"hyperlink",{"id":433,"type":434,"tags":435,"lang":437,"slug":438,"first_publication_date":439,"last_publication_date":440,"uid":441,"url":442,"link_type":12,"isBroken":69},"ZAH5lxIAACUA90WM","content-page",[436],"Corporate","en-gb","one-partner-end-to-end-","2023-03-03T14:40:25+0000","2026-04-10T11:00:16+0000","fulfilment-services","\u002Ffulfilment-services",{"start":429,"end":430,"type":83},{"dimensions":445,"alt":446,"copyright":20,"url":447,"id":448,"edit":449},{"width":54,"height":55},"Customer sat at a desk posing for a photo and smiling. Multiple parcels are shown in the foreground.","explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R6b5bqstJ9-SUg_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8742.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R6b5bqstJ9-SUg",{"x":42,"y":450,"zoom":43,"background":44},8,"Get in touch",{"link_type":30,"key":453,"url":32},"75678d86-5728-4981-9b0d-b46021c5ced1",{"link_type":34},"landing_feature_banner$1123c950-c330-4217-b027-76c73e4ef09b",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":457,"primary":488,"id":490,"slice_type":491,"slice_label":20},[458,464,470,476,482],{"questionTitle":459,"questionBody":460},"How sustainable is your delivery fleet?",[461],{"type":24,"text":462,"spans":463,"direction":27},"We're committed to Net Zero by 2035, operating electric vans, e-cargo bikes, and bio-CNG vehicles to cut emissions.",[],{"questionTitle":465,"questionBody":466},"Can I arrange an on-site tour or a virtual walkthrough of your facilities?",[467],{"type":24,"text":468,"spans":469,"direction":27},"Yes. We offer in-person tours by appointment, depending on location and availability. ",[],{"questionTitle":471,"questionBody":472},"Who do you typically work with?",[473],{"type":24,"text":474,"spans":475,"direction":27},"DTC brands, marketplaces, aggregators, B2B, and subscription services. ",[],{"questionTitle":477,"questionBody":478},"What are your minimum and maximum order volume thresholds?",[479],{"type":24,"text":480,"spans":481,"direction":27},"We work with startups and enterprises alike. While there are no strict minimums, we are optimised for businesses shipping more than 300 units per week or over 1200 per month, to maximise value and efficiency. ",[],{"questionTitle":483,"questionBody":484},"What are the minimum and maximum product dimensions and weights you can handle?",[485],{"type":24,"text":486,"spans":487,"direction":27},"Our fulfilment centres accommodate a broad range of sizes and weights, but specific limits vary by location. ",[],{"title":489},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$ffcc552f-75b6-4b89-9087-fc86463d5c67","frequently_asked_questions",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":493,"primary":509,"id":512,"slice_type":513,"slice_label":20},[494,505],{"title":495,"content":20,"pillEnabled":69,"link":496,"dataGtmTrack":20},"Frequently asked questions about Evri fulfilment",{"id":497,"type":434,"tags":498,"lang":437,"slug":499,"first_publication_date":500,"last_publication_date":501,"uid":502,"url":503,"link_type":12,"key":504,"isBroken":69},"Z9huzxAAACgA8MyH",[],"learn-about-evri-global-fulfilment--frequently-asked-questions","2025-03-17T18:59:27+0000","2026-04-10T07:02:48+0000","fulfilment-faqs","\u002Ffulfilment-faqs","946b8141-942b-43bf-9e65-0ea78f77e178",{"title":506,"content":20,"pillEnabled":69,"link":507,"dataGtmTrack":20},"Reach out today to sp